ont-size:14.52px\">1.建立解壓縮目錄</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">2.解壓縮檔案(Windows, macOS, Ubuntu)</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">3.搜尋符合條件所有CSV</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">4.批次匯入</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">5.資料基本檢視, 寬資料(Wide data)轉換至長資料(Long data)</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">6.dplyr 資料型態處理</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">7.變數:處理單位名稱警局層</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">8.變數:天候名稱</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14.52px\">9.變數:發生日期資料視覺化</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
